---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Tricouri basic albe si negre | Atelieraxd';
const description = 'Tricouri basic albe si negre pentru tinute casual cu pantaloni cu snur lung, pantaloni scurti si seturi lejere usor de purtat.';
const canonical = 'https://atelieraxd.ro/tricouri/';
const schema = {
  '@context':'https://schema.org',
  '@type':'CollectionPage',
  name:title,
  description,
  url:canonical,
  mainEntity: [
    { '@type':'Product', name:'Tricou alb basic', category:'tricouri basic' },
    { '@type':'Product', name:'Tricou negru basic', category:'tricouri basic' },
    { '@type':'Product', name:'Tricou negru oversized', category:'tricouri casual' }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} schema={schema}>
<section class="bg-white border-b border-ink/10">
  <div class="section grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr]">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">tricouri basic</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-black leading-tight md:text-6xl">Tricouri albe si negre pentru outfituri relaxate</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-ink/70">Modele basic, usor de combinat cu pantaloni cu snur lung, pantaloni scurti sau seturi casual. Pagina ramane pentru colectie; ghidurile separate explica outfiturile si ingrijirea fara sa concureze aceasta pagina.</p>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="btn-primary" href="/pantaloni-lungi">Combina cu pantaloni lungi</a><a class="btn-secondary" href="/blog/tricou-alb-pantaloni-negri-snur-lung/">Outfit alb-negru</a></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-mist">
      <img src="/images/seo-products/tricou-alb-basic-produs.png" alt="Tricou alb basic simplu din bumbac pentru tinute casual" title="Tricou alb basic" width="1254" height="1254" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" class="aspect-square w-full object-cover" />
      <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink/65">Tricou alb basic, prezentat clar pentru alegerea croielii si a materialului.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section"><div class="mb-8 flex items-end justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="eyebrow">colectie</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-black">Alege rapid tricoul potrivit</h2></div><a class="btn-secondary" href="/contact">Intreaba despre stoc</a></div><div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white"><img src="/images/seo-products/tricou-alb-basic-produs.png" alt="Tricou alb basic simplu pentru garderoba casual" title="Tricou alb basic simplu" width="1254" height="1254" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover"><div class="p-5"><h3 class="font-bold">Tricou alb basic</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/65">O baza luminoasa pentru pantaloni negri cu snur lung, pantaloni scurti sau seturi casual.</p><p class="mt-3 font-black">de la [PLACEHOLDER_PRET]</p></div></article><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white"><img src="/images/seo-products/tricou-alb-basic-pantaloni-negri-snur-lung.png" alt="Tricou alb basic purtat cu pantaloni negri scurti cu snur lung" title="Tricou alb cu pantaloni negri cu snur lung" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover object-top"><div class="p-5"><h3 class="font-bold">Tricou alb pentru outfit alb-negru</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/65">Contrast curat cu pantaloni negri si snur lung, potrivit pentru tinute unisex.</p><p class="mt-3 font-black">de la [PLACEHOLDER_PRET]</p></div></article><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white"><img src="/images/seo-products/tricou-negru-basic-produs.png" alt="Tricou negru basic simplu pentru tinute casual" title="Tricou negru basic simplu" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover"><div class="p-5"><h3 class="font-bold">Tricou negru basic</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/65">Simplu, neutru si usor de purtat cu pantaloni scurti sau lungi in zile active.</p><p class="mt-3 font-black">de la [PLACEHOLDER_PRET]</p></div></article></div></section><section class="section"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Outfit alb-negru</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/70">Un tricou alb basic merge natural cu pantaloni negri cu snur lung si sneakers albi.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex font-semibold text-clay" href="/blog/tricou-alb-pantaloni-negri-snur-lung/">Vezi outfitul</a></article><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Tricou negru simplu</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/70">Pentru tinute mai inchise, pastreaza intentia pe ghidul de stil cu tricou negru oversized.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex font-semibold text-clay" href="/blog/cum-porti-tricoul-negru-oversized/">Idei cu tricou negru</a></article><article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Material practic</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/70">Densitatea materialului, cusaturile si spalarea corecta conteaza pentru purtare zilnica.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex font-semibold text-clay" href="/blog/ingrijire-tricou-negru-bumbac/">Ghid de ingrijire</a></article></div></section>
</Layout>
